<section class="section section-full section-hero-header interior" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h1>Construction</h1>
    <p>
      We specialize in commercial construction projects of all sizes, from retail stores, 
      restaurants, and office fit-ups to ground-up commercial buildings. With an experienced 
      team and a commitment to quality craftsmanship, we deliver functional, high-quality 
      spaces built to meet your needs.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <div class="eyebrow primary">Our Services</div>
    <h2>Building with Care and Know-How</h2>
    <p class="sub-desc">Expert commercial construction services for retail, office, restaurant, and ground-up building projects.</p>
    <p>
      From retail stores to restaurants and offices, we know what it takes to get your space 
      built right. Whether it's a full build-out or a brand-new building from the ground up, 
      our team brings hands-on experience, attention to detail, and a strong work ethic to 
      every job.
    </p>
    <p>
      We handle a wide range of projects, from individual retail stores, restaurants, 
      offices, and daycares to full ground-up construction of new strip plazas and pad site 
      buildings. Our team includes experienced site superintendents, carpenters, framers, 
      drywallers, painters, and general laborers—all highly skilled in retail construction, 
      store fixturing, restaurant builds, office build-outs, and tenant fit-ups.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container-interior whats-included" data-reveal>
    <h3 data-reveal>Project Types</h3>
    <ul class="inluded-list">
      <li data-reveal>Retail store construction and fixturing</li>
      <li data-reveal>Restaurant build-outs</li>
      <li data-reveal>Office fit-ups and renovations</li>
      <li data-reveal>Daycare facility construction</li>
      <li data-reveal>Tenant improvements and leasehold work</li>
      <li data-reveal>Ground-up strip plaza construction</li>
      <li data-reveal>Pad site building construction</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full projects-page box-shadow" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="sub">Related Construction Projects</h2>

    <div class="related-projects-carousel">
      <div class="slideshow-viewport">
        <div class="project-grid slideshow-track">
          {% for project in projects %}
            {% if project.slug in featuredProjectSlugs %}
              <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="project-tile" data-category="{{ project.category | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">
                <div class="project-tile-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                {% if project.image %}
                  <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" />
                {% endif %}
                <div class="project-tile-overlay">
                  <span class="project-category">{{ project.category }}</span>
                  <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
                  <span class="view-project">View Project <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
                </div>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

